{
  "title": "Gamercoms — drift",
  "uid": "gamercoms-drift",
  "tags": [
    "gamercoms"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 0,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datakälla",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "loki",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Tjänst",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "label": "service_name",
          "refId": "svc",
          "type": 1
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Fel i perioden",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | level=\"error\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "0",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Varningar i perioden",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | level=\"warn\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "0",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fel och varningar över tid",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (level) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | level=~\"error|warn\" [$__auto]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{level}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "error"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "warn"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Värst drabbade routes",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Rader utan route är anrop mot sökvägar som inte finns — oftast sårbarhetsskannrar.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (route, status, service_name) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | level=~\"error|warn\" [$__range])))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "antal",
              "service_name": "tjänst"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "antal",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Svarstid p95",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, {service_name=~\"$service\"} | durationMs != \"\" | unwrap durationMs [$__auto]) by (service_name)",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Senaste fel och varningar",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\"} | level=~\"error|warn\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35
      },
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Om paneler är tomma",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Frågorna här är skrivna utan att ha kunnat testas mot er data — push-token saknar läsrättigheter. Två saker kan behöva justeras:\n\n1. **Etiketten.** Panelerna använder `service_name`. Kolla i panelen nedan vilken etikett tjänsterna faktiskt har.\n2. **Fälten.** Panelerna antar att `level`, `status`, `route` och `durationMs` är **strukturerad metadata**, alltså filtrerbara direkt: `| level=\"error\"`. Ligger de istället i loggtexten behövs `| json` först — byt då `| level=\"error\"` mot `| json | level=\"error\"` i varje panel.\n\nPanelen nedan visar råa rader utan något filter alls. Får du träffar där men inte ovanför, är det en av de två sakerna. Expandera en rad så ser du de verkliga fältnamnen."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46
      },
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Diagnostik — råa rader, inga filter",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\".+\"}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 52
      },
      "id": 8
    }
  ]
}
